config SENSEI_BUSARB
	bool "Arbitration of the shared SPI_A bus and LTE current peaks"
	help
	  One owner at a time for SPI_A (P0.08 to P0.11, shared by GAP9 and the LPWAN shield) and a rule
	  that GAP9 does not run during an LTE transmission. Selected by SENSEI_GAP9 and SENSEI_LPWAN.
